    "detailed_description": "Hogvalord: The ranch is a relaxing and casual creature raising game. Immerse yourself in the joy of nurturing a variety of adorable Hogragons, explore landscapes with your newfound companions, and personalize your charming ranch with creative decorations. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/2204679ef2660306818b7e38dab7ad95.avif?t=1731290989\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hatch and raise all type of Hogragons. Tending to their daily needs, watching them grow.<br></li><li>Evolve your Hogragons, each has their own features and special ability.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/db7a4a97a36cf05981d0fb7bf0a98246.poster.avif?t=1731290989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/db7a4a97a36cf05981d0fb7bf0a98246.webm?t=1731290989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/db7a4a97a36cf05981d0fb7bf0a98246.mp4?t=1731290989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>Build houses and workplace to get extra income and products.<br></li><li>Decorate your ranch with various plants and stuffs.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/771d5888706fb85f32eeb7407f6fce49.poster.avif?t=1731290989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/771d5888706fb85f32eeb7407f6fce49.webm?t=1731290989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/771d5888706fb85f32eeb7407f6fce49.mp4?t=1731290989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>Enjoy a chill flight with the Hogragons as you search for exotic items.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/9fe1aee7a8e717b94e812e28dcf9fe67.poster.avif?t=1731290989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/9fe1aee7a8e717b94e812e28dcf9fe67.webm?t=1731290989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/9fe1aee7a8e717b94e812e28dcf9fe67.mp4?t=1731290989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/7d021352b47621cf8a8c8da9b4a6bc33.avif?t=1731290989\" /></div><br>Hogvalord: The Ranch is a standalone title that takes place in the same universe of Hogvalord. A century after Lucas and his companions unveiled the secret of Hogragon, bringing these legendary beings back to the mortal realm, Hogragon has evolved into a coveted companion for all. Being a Hogmaster has become the dream profession for every child. Each year, newly graduated Hogmasters will be sent on a journey to remote regions. Their mission is to establish and nurture a ranch, help connecting these adorable creatures with new friends, allowing the locals to adopt their very own Hogragon.",
    "about_the_game": "Hogvalord: The ranch is a relaxing and casual creature raising game. Immerse yourself in the joy of nurturing a variety of adorable Hogragons, explore landscapes with your newfound companions, and personalize your charming ranch with creative decorations. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/2204679ef2660306818b7e38dab7ad95.avif?t=1731290989\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hatch and raise all type of Hogragons. Tending to their daily needs, watching them grow.<br></li><li>Evolve your Hogragons, each has their own features and special ability.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/db7a4a97a36cf05981d0fb7bf0a98246.poster.avif?t=1731290989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/db7a4a97a36cf05981d0fb7bf0a98246.webm?t=1731290989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/db7a4a97a36cf05981d0fb7bf0a98246.mp4?t=1731290989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>Build houses and workplace to get extra income and products.<br></li><li>Decorate your ranch with various plants and stuffs.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/771d5888706fb85f32eeb7407f6fce49.poster.avif?t=1731290989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/771d5888706fb85f32eeb7407f6fce49.webm?t=1731290989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/771d5888706fb85f32eeb7407f6fce49.mp4?t=1731290989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>Enjoy a chill flight with the Hogragons as you search for exotic items.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/9fe1aee7a8e717b94e812e28dcf9fe67.poster.avif?t=1731290989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/9fe1aee7a8e717b94e812e28dcf9fe67.webm?t=1731290989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/9fe1aee7a8e717b94e812e28dcf9fe67.mp4?t=1731290989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829110/extras/7d021352b47621cf8a8c8da9b4a6bc33.avif?t=1731290989\" /></div><br>Hogvalord: The Ranch is a standalone title that takes place in the same universe of Hogvalord. A century after Lucas and his companions unveiled the secret of Hogragon, bringing these legendary beings back to the mortal realm, Hogragon has evolved into a coveted companion for all. Being a Hogmaster has become the dream profession for every child. Each year, newly graduated Hogmasters will be sent on a journey to remote regions. Their mission is to establish and nurture a ranch, help connecting these adorable creatures with new friends, allowing the locals to adopt their very own Hogragon.",
    "short_description": "Play as a fresh graduated Hogmaster and manage your own ranch in a remote land. Collect different types of Hogragon egg, raise them up, roaming forests, show everyone in the kingdom how adorable these mythical beings are. Build houses and workshops, design this ranch to your heart's content!",
